00:22:41,739 --> 00:22:47,739
Every school day, African-American teenagers William Gates and Arthur Agee
travel 90 minutes each way from inner-city Chicago to St.

4
00:30:15,652 --> 00:30:21,652
Joseph High School in Westchester, Illinois, a predominately white suburban
school well-known for the excellence of its basketball program.

5
00:37:49,565 --> 00:37:55,565
Gates and Agee dream of NBA stardom, and with the support of their close-knit families,
they battle the social and physical obstacles that stand in their way.

6
